BINDER explicit prop hBT : B ⊆ closure T₁ ∩ closure T₂
CONCL ∃ θ₁ θ₂, F.IsRingArc w θ₁ θ₂ c₁ c₂ ∧ y ∈ HadwigerNelson.Plane.ringArc w θ₁ θ₂
@@ THM Proofs.HadwigerNelson.Plane.RingCalculus.SemiHub HadwigerNelson.Plane.ArcMap.isSemiHub_iff_qSide
