BINDER explicit data i : Fin n
CONCL ∃ α ∈ F.arcs, ∃ B, α.InitialPiece x (G.β (HadwigerNelson.Plane.BranchGerms.next i)) B ∧ B ⊆ closure (G.sector x r₀ i) ∩ closure (G.sector x r₀ (HadwigerNelson.Plane.BranchGerms.next i))
